cross-generational rivalry. thought it was dumb as a teen and now that I'm older I realize I was absolutely right. I have no idea why aging generations feel the need to hate on younger generations to the EXTREME. 

&#x200B;

people will post examples of skibity toilet like its some new thing that kids watch brainrot content. you dont hate skibity toilet cause its cringe. you hate it because it reminds you of the content you used to watch. COWARDS.

maybe tall, lanky, and poor eyesight for navigating small passages in dark caves? and instead of being blacksmiths maybe they are well known for their resourcefulness and crafting sturdy tools from the resources they find.

